Correct Answer
Set up your production profile
Explanation of the Correct Answer
Setting up your production profile is the foundational step. It allows the system to understand your specific implementation needs and tailor recommendations accordingly.
The production profile captures key details about your environment, configurations, and goals. This information is crucial for personalized guidance.
Analysis of Other Options
Manage programs: Managing programs is a later step, dependent on having a defined profile.
Build feature roadmaps: Building roadmaps comes after understanding your current state and desired outcomes, which the production profile helps define.
Manage projects: Project management is a separate activity that benefits from, but doesn't precede, setting up the production profile.
Key Takeaways
Always start with foundational setup steps to enable personalization and tailored guidance.
The production profile is the cornerstone for receiving relevant recommendations.
Correct Answer
Solution Description
Explanation of the Correct Answer
The Solution Description document provides a detailed overview of Oracle Modern Best Practices (OMBP), including use cases, personas, and usernames.
This document is designed to help users understand how OMBP can be applied to their specific business needs.
Analysis of Other Options
Oracle Guided Learning: This is a tool for interactive training, not a document.
Roadmap: Roadmaps outline feature adoption plans, not OMBP details.
Marko: This is not a recognized term or document in this context.
Project Charter 1 Pager: This document outlines project scope and objectives, not OMBP details.
Key Takeaways
Solution Descriptions are key documents for understanding OMBP use cases.
Look for documents that provide comprehensive overviews when seeking detailed information.
