The "Production Team Member" role is specifically designated to have update permissions for the Production Profile.
This role is intended for individuals actively involved in managing and maintaining the production environment details.
Analysis of Other Options
Team Member: This role likely has more general access but not necessarily update permissions for the Production Profile.
Viewer: Viewers have read-only access.
Partner: Partner access may vary but doesn't inherently grant Production Profile update permissions.
Key Takeaways
Role-based access control is crucial for managing permissions.
