Correct Answer
Milestone Objectives and Entry/Exit Criteria
Explanation of the Correct Answer
Cloud Quality Standards are built around defining clear objectives for each milestone and establishing specific criteria that must be met to enter and exit each phase.
This ensures a structured and controlled implementation process.
Analysis of Other Options
Milestone Objectives: While important, objectives alone are insufficient without defined criteria.
General Guidance and Best Practices: These are helpful but not the core elements of Cloud Quality Standards.
Milestone Entry/Exit Criteria: Criteria alone are meaningless without defined objectives.
Key Takeaways
Cloud Quality Standards rely on a combination of objectives and measurable criteria.
Entry/Exit criteria provide a clear framework for assessing progress.
